            "currentUpdate": "With hearing support, he repeatedly declines biopsy because he has always been healthy and believes the possible consequences apply to people who have been ill. The surgeon explains that the concern relates to his own lump. His response remains the same. A verified health-care power of attorney authorizes his wife to act if he cannot make this decision.",
