            "currentUpdate": "While capable, he accepted postoperative ventilation as a trial directed at recognizing family and communicating his wishes. His recorded plan limits treatment to comfort measures if that goal becomes unattainable. A later clinical assessment finds that this recovery cannot occur. His verified agent daughter requests implementation of the recorded plan, and the authorized hospital process confirms its applicability.",
