            "questionVariantId": "question.topic.ethics-professionalism.r3.donation-role.v3",
            "primaryConceptId": "concept.topic.ethics-professionalism.r3.dcd-care-certification-independence.v1",
            "currentUpdate": "The record establishes {patientName}’s inability to decide and his wife’s verified agent authority. The withdrawal decision and donation authorization are complete. Dr. Kim is assigned as the bedside attending. Dr. Patel holds hospital intensive-care privileges and is on the organ-recovery operative roster. Dr. Evans is the procurement organization’s physician. Each has the hospital’s required training and general clinical privileges for circulatory-death determination.",
            "stem": "Which physician should declare {patientName}'s death under the controlled-donation protocol?",
